WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.260
Went to the School of Visual Arts in Manhattan, studying first fine arts.

2
00:00:06.260 --> 00:00:08.820
Then I switched over to illustration.

3
00:00:08.820 --> 00:00:10.100
I never did graduate.

4
00:00:10.100 --> 00:00:13.660
I started working while I was in school.

5
00:00:13.660 --> 00:00:18.120
So that’s from elementary school, you were in like an arts-geared school . . . specialized school?

6
00:00:18.120 --> 00:00:23.960
Well, that was college, School of Visual Arts, but elementary school, I was interested in art.

7
00:00:23.960 --> 00:00:25.720
Forever.

8
00:00:25.720 --> 00:00:33.500
I have my third grade report card at my desk where I failed every subject except for art.

9
00:00:33.500 --> 00:00:33.700
Except for art.

10
00:00:33.500 --> 00:00:36.120
Yeah, and I got left back in third grade.

11
00:00:36.120 --> 00:00:37.940
I’m completely dyslexic.

12
00:00:37.940 --> 00:00:43.620
And school was kind of hard, but art wasn’t, so I focused on what my strengths were.
